  "prefLabel": "Ec-Wtr 100 DEFINITIONS, ORGANIZATION, AND PUBLIC INFORMATION",
  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Ec-Wtr 100 DEFINITIONS, ORGANIZATION, AND PUBLIC INFORMATION\n\nStatutory Authority: RSA 21-O:14, IV; RSA 541-A:16, I(a); and RSA 541:30-a\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nDocument #13923, effective 4-11-24, readopted with amendments and renumbered the former Chapter Env-WC 100 and Chapter Env-WC 200 as Chapter Ec-Wtr 100 and Chapter Ec-Wtr 200. Document #13923 also changed the title of the former Chapter Env-WC 100 from “Organizational Rules” to “Definitions, Organization, and Public Information”. The title of the former Chapter Env-WC 200 remained as “Procedural Rules”. The renumbering of rules with the subtitle “Env-WC” to “Ec-Wtr” was done pursuant to a rules redesignation plan for the Council’s rules approved by the Director of the Office of Legislative Services in 2021.\n\nDocument #13923 replaced all prior filings affecting the rules in the former Chapter Env-WC 100 and Chapter Env-WC 200. The prior filing affecting the rules in the former Chapter Env-WC 100 was Document #8976, effective 9-14-07. The rules were subject to expiration only pursuant to RSA 541-A:17, II:\n\nAs organizational rules, the rules in Chapter Ec-Wtr 100 in Document #13923 will not expire except pursuant to RSA 541-A:17, II.",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ec-wtr100.html"
